        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-06T16:27:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/content/fourth-reveal-biomancer\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Biomancer</a>&nbsp;has a strong resemblance to <a href=\"http://static.comicvine.com/uploads/scale_small/3/31666/746603-alchemy_1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Doctor Alchemy</a></p><p>Whats funny is that Doctor Alchemy weilds a philosophers stone just like the Scholar, the nemesis to Biomancer.&nbsp;<span>Doctor Alchemy is also a Flash villain (usually seen with the Rogues Gallery), and we first see Biomancer in Tachyons deck.</span></p><p><span>I feel kinda dumb for not connecting these dots ealier. Makes me wonder what other easy dots have we been missing along the way?</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
